{"id":"wb-7-545","name":"东山大石盖墓","title":"东山大石盖墓","status":"catalogue","text":"东山大石盖墓位于辽宁省丹东市凤城市，是全国重点文物保护单位。名录记载的时代为夏、商，文物类型为古墓葬，本条按第七批名录收录。","sourceUrl":"http://www.ncha.gov.cn/module/download/downfile.jsp?classid=0&filename=1406261621052128423.pdf","sourceName":"公布名录","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/02d60cbf39dd025f7cc4164d.jpg","title":"管家东山大石盖墓.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%AE%A1%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%9C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A4%A7%E7%9F%B3%E7%9B%96%E5%A2%93.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d8/%E7%AE%A1%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%9C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A4%A7%E7%9F%B3%E7%9B%96%E5%A2%93.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Wei Wang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​东山大石盖墓位于辽宁省凤城市草河街道管家村西赫家堡。大石盖墓大致呈三部分分布：一在山丘顶部，一在山下的坡地，一在东山西侧约1000米的西山。墓与墓之问相距约4—7米，分布面积约5000平方米。","width":320,"height":148,"matchEvidence":"维基共享资源名称与所在地一致"}}